WEBVTT

01:29.810 --> 01:33.090
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.640 --> 01:36.240
[Episode 3]

01:43.479 --> 01:44.810
Is it done?

01:45.330 --> 01:46.759
Along with the two attendants,

01:46.759 --> 01:48.620
they've been disposed of as well.

01:49.479 --> 01:51.720
It's his own arrogance to blame.

01:51.740 --> 01:53.479
He didn't even know who he offended.

01:53.479 --> 01:55.780
But he was our guest after all.

01:56.200 --> 01:57.860
What if someone looks into it?

01:58.960 --> 02:00.120
Don't worry.

02:01.020 --> 02:02.700
The one who wanted him dead

02:02.730 --> 02:03.810
will handle it.

02:05.600 --> 02:07.430
Where did you go

02:08.530 --> 02:10.259
during tonight's death match?

02:12.680 --> 02:14.680
I saw the death match was about to fail,

02:14.680 --> 02:16.300
so I planned to step in myself.

02:16.300 --> 02:17.329
Unexpectedly,

02:17.350 --> 02:18.510
I was still too late,

02:18.700 --> 02:20.250
and accidentally let those three

02:20.250 --> 02:21.450
slip through by luck.

02:25.079 --> 02:26.140
It doesn't matter.

02:26.400 --> 02:27.320
Even if

02:27.320 --> 02:28.550
they escape this level,

02:28.550 --> 02:30.210
they will die sooner or later.

02:30.820 --> 02:32.200
But Wujiu,

02:32.310 --> 02:33.640
I have to remind you:

02:33.680 --> 02:35.079
if I find out

02:35.079 --> 02:36.200
that it was you

02:37.000 --> 02:39.000
who broke the rules of Lingya Tower,

02:40.540 --> 02:42.340
I will absolutely show no mercy.

02:46.530 --> 02:47.680
We've had our fun

02:47.680 --> 02:49.270
and the vermin have been eliminated.

02:49.270 --> 02:50.630
Send those three

02:51.120 --> 02:52.260
up to the next level.

02:52.730 --> 02:53.410
Yes.

03:11.090 --> 03:14.780
[Second Level: Elite Academy]

03:49.300 --> 03:50.400
Where is this?

03:51.320 --> 03:54.170
Are we out of Lingya Tower?

04:01.200 --> 04:02.680
Is this yours?

04:06.160 --> 04:07.490
Who told you to touch it?

04:07.850 --> 04:08.680
I didn't.

04:09.080 --> 04:10.400
I didn't know it was yours.

04:10.400 --> 04:12.090
I just picked it up.

04:12.120 --> 04:13.030
If you ever touch my things again,

04:13.030 --> 04:14.560
I'll chop your hands off, got it?

04:14.560 --> 04:16.160
How can you be so unreasonable?

04:16.160 --> 04:18.440
-She meant well.
-I don't need it.

04:18.480 --> 04:19.800
Can you two stop

04:19.800 --> 04:20.870
being so hypocritical here?

04:20.870 --> 04:21.950
What is this place?

04:22.000 --> 04:23.080
Lingya Tower.

04:23.080 --> 04:24.560
You know exactly
what kind of people you are,

04:24.560 --> 04:25.820
and how you got in here.

04:25.920 --> 04:27.530
Don't play dumb.

04:29.160 --> 04:30.280
In Lingya Tower,

04:30.550 --> 04:31.440
it's either kill

04:31.440 --> 04:32.280
or be killed.

04:32.280 --> 04:33.680
Don't give me that sisterhood nonsense

04:33.680 --> 04:35.080
or your scheming tricks.

04:37.200 --> 04:38.000
Right.

04:38.930 --> 04:40.560
There are no good people in this tower.

04:40.560 --> 04:41.690
They are all beasts.

04:43.020 --> 04:44.170
But an extra ally

04:44.190 --> 04:46.250
is better than an extra enemy, right?

04:46.530 --> 04:48.250
Who knows, maybe when you die one day,

04:48.250 --> 04:50.180
someone might be there to bury you.

04:50.840 --> 04:52.520
How kind of you.

05:01.300 --> 05:03.020
Speak no evil.

05:16.730 --> 05:19.150
[The Voice-keeper of the Second Level:
Qin Yuren]

05:16.840 --> 05:18.570
I am the voice-keeper here.

05:18.590 --> 05:19.890
Qin Yuren.

05:20.000 --> 05:21.680
You can call me Madam Qin.

05:24.040 --> 05:26.520
Your mother was poisoned
by Lingya Tower's toxin.

05:26.520 --> 05:28.920
I can only temporarily contain its spread.

05:32.960 --> 05:33.840
Master,

05:34.080 --> 05:35.159
what is this?

05:38.490 --> 05:39.680
The Guiding Ring.

05:41.560 --> 05:43.159
Welcome to the death match

05:43.159 --> 05:45.120
on the second level of Lingya Tower.

05:45.120 --> 05:46.280
Death match?

05:46.720 --> 05:48.320
It's starting so soon?

05:48.440 --> 05:50.040
Our Elite School

05:50.040 --> 05:52.020
uses exams as death matches.

05:52.159 --> 05:53.400
Those with excellent grades

05:53.400 --> 05:55.280
can be promoted to the upper level.

05:55.280 --> 05:56.890
The rest who fail,

05:57.280 --> 05:59.520
as long as they're willing
to remain my students,

05:59.520 --> 06:01.280
can stay here indefinitely.

06:03.600 --> 06:04.520
That sounds

06:04.520 --> 06:07.650
a million times better
than the lower level, doesn't it?

06:21.570 --> 06:22.330
This...

06:23.320 --> 06:24.750
This place is so nice!

06:27.160 --> 06:29.160
Why don't we just stay here?

06:29.280 --> 06:31.420
Then we don't have to
take part in any death matches.

06:31.420 --> 06:32.840
Stay if you want.

06:33.000 --> 06:34.280
Looking at all these books

06:34.280 --> 06:36.140
just gives me a massive headache.

06:36.180 --> 06:37.450
If we stay here,

06:37.600 --> 06:39.520
without participating in the death match

06:39.520 --> 06:41.120
or attending these classes,

06:41.480 --> 06:42.740
what will happen to us?

06:44.310 --> 06:46.000
If someone always fails to learn,

06:46.000 --> 06:47.930
they're definitely a bad student.

06:48.480 --> 06:50.280
When such a hard-won opportunity

06:50.280 --> 06:51.640
isn't cherished,

06:53.320 --> 06:54.640
then the only option is

06:55.370 --> 06:56.510
to kill them.

07:05.540 --> 07:07.700
[First Meeting]

07:28.380 --> 07:31.240
My mother made this rabbit meat
especially for you.

07:33.360 --> 07:35.010
Can I be your apprentice?

07:36.470 --> 07:38.080
I like rabbit meat too.

07:38.159 --> 07:40.020
Can you teach me how to catch them?

07:45.080 --> 07:47.340
Look, my braiding isn't that bad, right?

07:49.510 --> 07:50.380
Master.

07:50.510 --> 07:52.430
When will you start teaching me?

07:52.740 --> 07:55.200
When did I agree
to take you as my apprentice?

07:55.860 --> 07:57.940
For the sake of me combing your hair,

07:57.970 --> 07:59.700
won't you consider it, Master?

08:00.400 --> 08:01.880
I've never taken an apprentice.

08:01.880 --> 08:02.640
I don't know how to teach.

08:02.640 --> 08:04.850
I've never had a master either.

08:05.320 --> 08:07.250
We can just look out for each other.

08:08.880 --> 08:10.010
I'll think about it.

08:11.320 --> 08:12.990
I'll take that as a yes.

08:13.560 --> 08:14.960
Let's pinky swear on it.

08:14.960 --> 08:15.840
No backing out.

08:15.990 --> 08:19.920
Do you know how much pain and suffering
it takes to master these skills?

08:23.160 --> 08:24.290
Look, Master!
